    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6803" root="جيح" body-key="j">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاحَتِ الآفَةُ المَالَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَجِيحُهُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِيَاحَةٌ</span>,
[perhaps a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَائِحَةٌ</span>,] <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاحَتْهُ</span>
of which the aor. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَجُوحُهُ</span>: see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جوح</span>. (Msb.)
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاحَهُمُ ٱللّٰهُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيْحٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَائِحَةٌ</span>, the latter
an inf. n. like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَافِيَةٌ</span>, <i>God afflicted them with a
calamity.</i> (TA.)

